        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Slice Text\n\nTakes a fixed range of characters out of a string by index. Use it to cut a caption to a length limit. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**How it works:** \"Text\" holds a sample string of digits and letters. \"Slice\" is a Code node that returns the characters between its start and end inputs, and \"Excerpt\" shows the result.\n\n**Try this:** Set end to 4 on \"Slice\" to keep only the first four characters, then paste a long caption into \"Text\"."
        },
